                    				<td align="left" style="padding:20px 30px; font-family: arial, helvetica, myriad pro, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color:#666666; line-height: 140%;"><span style="color:#0076C5; font-size:15px;"><strong><span class="eloquaemail">Hello [FirstName]</span>,</strong></span><br />

<p>Welcome to Intel<span style="vertical-align:super;font-size:10px;line-height: 0px;">&reg;</span> Technology Provider AI Data Center Specialty Benefits!  As a AI Data Center Specialist you can take advantage of Specialty Benefits specifically designed to help you create winning cloud solutions and give you a competitive edge in the marketplace when deploying Intel<span style="vertical-align:super;font-size:10px;line-height: 0px;">&reg;</span>-based solutions.</p>

<p>As a qualified AI Data Center Specialist, you are eligible for Specialty Benefits* that are designed to help you grow your cloud business including:</p>

<ul>
	<li>AI Data Center Specialist designation</li>

	<li>Intel Promotion of your Company as a Cloud Specialist</li>

	<li>Customer Matchmaking Opportunities</li>

	<li>Additional Points when purchasing Intel<span style="vertical-align:super;font-size:10px;line-height: 0px;">&reg;</span> Server Products for Cloud</li>

	<li>Access to Intel Cloud Resources</li>

	<li>Facilitated qualification for Intel<span style="vertical-align:super;font-size:10px;line-height: 0px;">&reg;</span> Cloud Builders</li>

	<li>Priority invitations to industry events and training sessions</li>

	<li>Access to Cloud Experts</li>
</ul>

<p>Thank you again for being an active Intel Technology Provider.</p>

<p style="margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 30px;"><a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/technology-provider/cloud-specialty-benefits.html" target="_blank"
style="background-color:#ffa300;border-radius:3px;color:#fff;display:inline-block;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;line-height:45px;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;width:160px;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;">Access Benefits &gt;</a></p>

<span style="font-size: 9px;">*Benefits may vary by geography.</span></p>

